@startuml
title S-CORE Lifecycle | Type Model (Process / Recovery / Health Monitor)
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #4F5D75
skinparam classBorderColor #2D3142
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classFontColor #2D3142
skinparam classAttributeFontColor #2D3142
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #BFC0C0

enum ProcessState {
  kIdle = 0
  kStarting = 1
  kRunning = 2
  kTerminating = 3
  kTerminated = 4
  kFailed = 5
}

enum GraphState {
  kSuccess = 0
  kInTransition = 1
  kAborting = 2
  kCancelled = 3
  kUndefinedState = 4
}

enum SupervisionStatus {
  kOk = 0
  kFailed = 1
}

enum FailedSupervisionType {
  kHeartbeat = 0
  kDeadline = 1
  kLogic = 2
}

enum DeadlineError {
  kTooEarly = 0
  kTooLate = 1
}

enum HeartbeatError {
  kTooEarly = 0
  kTooLate = 1
  kMultipleHeartbeats = 2
}

enum LogicError {
  kInvalidState = 0
  kInvalidTransition = 1
  kUnmappedError = 2
}

class HealthMonitorState {
  +supervision_status : SupervisionStatus
  +failed_supervision_type : FailedSupervisionType
  +failed_supervision_cycles : uint32
  +deadline_error : DeadlineError
  +heartbeat_error : HeartbeatError
  +logic_error : LogicError
  +deadline_violation : bool
  +alive_indication_count : uint32
}

class ProcessInfoNode {
  +getPid() : osal::ProcessID
  +getState() : ProcessState
  +getTerminationTimeout() : milliseconds
  +getControlClientChannel() : ControlClientChannelP
}

class RestartAction {
  +number_of_attempts : uint32
  +delay_before_restart_ms : uint32
}

class SwitchRunTargetAction {
  +run_target : string
}

class ComponentConfig {
  +ready_recovery_action : optional<RestartAction>
  +recovery_action : optional<SwitchRunTargetAction>
}

ProcessInfoNode --> ProcessState : getState()
HealthMonitorState --> SupervisionStatus : supervision_status
HealthMonitorState --> FailedSupervisionType : failed_supervision_type
HealthMonitorState --> DeadlineError : deadline_error
HealthMonitorState --> HeartbeatError : heartbeat_error
HealthMonitorState --> LogicError : logic_error
ComponentConfig "1" o-- "0..1" RestartAction : ready_recovery_action
ComponentConfig "1" o-- "0..1" SwitchRunTargetAction : recovery_action

note right of ComponentConfig
RestartAction and SwitchRunTargetAction are two
DISTINCT config structs in two DIFFERENT optional
slots -- not a tagged union / single enum.
Only one slot is populated per component config.
end note

note bottom of ProcessInfoNode
exit_code, pid (outside getPid()), and
process_execution_error are NOT exposed via
getters on this class -- only observable via
the external monitor notification callback
(comp_req_launch_man_ext_monitor_notify).
end note

note right of HealthMonitorState
Health Monitor supervision fields map to
score-lifecycle-state RawEvidenceSchema
(supervision_status, failed_supervision_type,
deadline_error, heartbeat_error, logic_error,
deadline_violation, failed_supervision_cycles,
alive_indication_count).
end note
@enduml
